@Zofia_Yilmaz,
This is a great question and definitely one we've discussed in product development and marketing meetings.

In the past we've found that the best indicator of repeat behavior has been a pattern where a customer has placed 3 or more orders within a 4-week period, but only ever bought a single item that's part of a new recurring set (usually a box of 4 or 6, like our rolling cars or vehicles).
